295	// SnapshotPathStreamer implements io.ReadCloser for streaming a snapshot's
296	// data, where the snapshot data is a directory containing WAL files. It creates
297	// the SnapshotHeader on the fly based on the provided directory path, and then
298	// streams the header to readers. The path is set in the header, and no more
299	// data follows the header. Instead the client is expected to read the header,
